    "description": "Errors (FP/FN) attributed to QF_NIA constraints. Reshape's batch*seq=total is QF_NIA, beyond QF_LIA. Z3 handles concrete-c factor-pair enumeration (a*b=c with c known) but may struggle with fully symbolic products.",
